# Vendored TV-Anytime schemas, copied verbatim from ETSI's published
# package (see agenda/tvanytime/schemas/README.md). They ship with CRLF
# line endings, and `-text` stops git normalizing them: the README claims
# these files are byte-identical to the published ones, and refreshing to a
# new TV-Anytime version should diff as the spec actually changed rather
# than as every line having moved.
agenda/tvanytime/schemas/*.xsd -text
